      "exposure": "Federal binary definition, X-marker issuance stopped, and February 2025 cable: document discrepancy leads to refusal and added evidence; suspected wilful misrepresentation can support permanent fraud ineligibility. Passports reported confiscated/blocked; allied advisories and visa detentions documented.",
