      "protection": "On 17 July 2026 a county court found a man violated the state civil-rights act by striking a trans woman. Gender-identity hate-crime enhancements date to 2019, the panic defence was abolished in 2024, and 88% poll support for protections was recorded.",
      "interaction": "Functioning state enforcement mitigates public hostility locally, but does not remedy federal border, facilities or custody exposures.",
      "status": "uncertain"
